      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2682,
      "text": "and those who properly observe their prayers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2683,
      "text": "Such will be the inheritors,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2684,
      "text": "who will inherit Paradise[3]; they will abide therein forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2685,
      "text": "We created man[4] from an extract of clay,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2686,
      "text": "then We placed him as a sperm-drop[5] in a safe place,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2687,
      "text": "then We made the sperm drop into a clinging clot, then We made the clinging clot into a lump, then We made the lump into bones, and We clothed the bones with flesh, and then We developed it into another creation[6]. So Blessed is Allah, the Best of Creators.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2688,
      "text": "Then after that you will surely die,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2689,
      "text": "then on the Day of Resurrection, you will surely be resurrected.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 342,
      "ruku": 295,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
